---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Smart Trader VIP - Global Financial Intelligence" activeNav="About Us" description="Our mission, quantitative architecture, and execution framework for modern institutional traders and automation builders.">

  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-950/60 border border-emerald-800/60 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Global Intelligence Desk</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mt-4 mb-4">Smart Trader VIP</h1>
      <p class="text-base text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Bridging the institutional gap: Delivering hedge-fund grade SMC intelligence, multi-thread isolation infrastructure, and automated MT5 execution.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-base">
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>🎯 Our Core Philosophy</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          In modern quantitative markets, the dividing line between retail speculation and sustained capital preservation is defined by <strong>information latency, rigorous mathematical risk management, and technological execution</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Smart Trader VIP (smarttrader.vip)</strong> was founded to provide transparent, unvarnished market intelligence: from institutional liquidity sweeps to turnkey MT5 automated systems that stand up to real market drawdowns.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🛒</div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">MMO & Cloud Store</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">High-concurrency residential IPv4 proxies, dedicated VPS, and anti-detect profile fleets reducing scaling costs by 70%.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🎯</div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">VIP Trading Signals</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Real-time SMC trade telemetry on Gold and Crypto with verified 78.5% win rate and direct MT5 Webhook integration.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🤖</div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Automated Bot EA</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Live Myfxbook track records with sub-10% maximum drawdown caps and institutional micro-lot compounding.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-950/40 to-slate-900 border border-emerald-800/60 text-center">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Direct Institutional Desk</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 mb-6 max-w-lg mx-auto">
          For custom algorithmic integrations, broker partnership onboarding, or dedicated technical support, connect directly with our engineering desk.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="https://t.me/smarttradervip" target="_blank" class="px-6 py-3 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-slate-950 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider rounded-xl transition-all shadow-lg">
            ✈️ Official Telegram Channel
          </a>
          <a href="https://t.me/willrich" target="_blank" class="px-6 py-3 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider rounded-xl border border-slate-700 transition-all">
            💬 Founder Direct Contact (@willrich)
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
